synonym: "extensor digiti minimi (hand)" RELATED [Wikipedia:Extensor_digiti_minimi_muscle]
synonym: "extensor digiti quinti proprius" RELATED [http://www.anatomyatlases.org/AnatomicVariants/MuscularSystem/Text/E/14Extensor.shtml, Wikipedia:Extensor_digiti_minimi_muscle]
